{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>ATTENTION, COMRADES!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Earth no longer belongs to us. They came suddenly \u2014 destroying everything in their path. It has been six months since the invasion began. The nations of the world formed the Earth Defense Council, and despite the fall of many cities, we continue to fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Another operation is about to begin. You are part of this mission. One of the soldiers sent below. The task is clear: clear the sector.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667820/extras/lasergun.gif?t=1744900946\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FEATURES OF THE DEMO VERSION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The demo <i>ReLinked 0.0.26091975</i> was developed in 3 days during Ludum Dare 57.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Available in the demo:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A level of 10 procedurally generated floors with increasing difficulty;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A fully destructible environment;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">10 types of weapons across three categories (ballistic, energy, psionic), including assault rifles, shotguns, rifles, plasma and laser rifles, tesla guns;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">15 modules, such as vampirism, bullet duplication, ricochet, piercing, stun, and more;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Two types of enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667820/extras/plasmagun.gif?t=1744900946\" /></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3667820?t=1744900946","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3667820?t=1744900946","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667820/b54a1bcb0e824473df9fd70af5d345bd8cf50753/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744900946","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667820/b54a1bcb0e824473df9fd70af5d345bd8cf50753/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744900946","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>ATTENTION, COMRADES!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Earth no longer belongs to us. They came suddenly \u2014 destroying everything in their path. It has been six months since the invasion began. The nations of the world formed the Earth Defense Council, and despite the fall of many cities, we continue to fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Another operation is about to begin. You are part of this mission. One of the soldiers sent below. The task is clear: clear the sector.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667820/extras/lasergun.gif?t=1744900946\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FEATURES OF THE DEMO VERSION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The demo <i>ReLinked 0.0.26091975</i> was developed in 3 days during Ludum Dare 57.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Available in the demo:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A level of 10 procedurally generated floors with increasing difficulty;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A fully destructible environment;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">10 types of weapons across three categories (ballistic, energy, psionic), including assault rifles, shotguns, rifles, plasma and laser rifles, tesla guns;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">15 modules, such as vampirism, bullet duplication, ricochet, piercing, stun, and more;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Two types of enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667820/extras/plasmagun.gif?t=1744900946\" /></p></li></ul>","developers":["Sempiernal Rain"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3666780","name":"ReLinked 0.26091975"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667820/1d59c480dfe0843df8fd739763aa631f1426bda6/header.jpg?t=1744900946","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257125616,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257125616/movie480.mp4?t=1744900884","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257125616/movie_max.mp4?t=1744900884"},"name":"Gameplay Demo Teaser","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257125616/6e5d0a6f8d7cb1b4ae851db75052c8bf1e27a2f9/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1744900884","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257125616/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1744900884","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257125616/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1744900884"}}],"name":"ReLinked 0.26091975 Demo","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong>  Intel i3 or higher<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 1060 or better<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 300 MB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Sempiernal Rain"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Viol\u00eancia","rating":"10","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"10","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Gewalt","rating":"12","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"12","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":false,"date":"17 Apr, 2025"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.